{"created": "2026-07-18T02:31:35.025959+00:00", "modified": "2026-07-18T02:34:13.770491+00:00", "id": 21422432, "conceptrecid": "21124403", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21422432", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21124403", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21422432", "metadata": {"title": "Interlanguage and Mathematical Translation Methodology Sidecar", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21422432", "publication_date": "2026-07-18", "description": "<p>This is the methodology and reproducibility sidecar for the AI-run mathematical translation program. It gathers the working methods, source-body baselines, linguistic routing material, weighted automata and terminology ledgers, normalization evidence, validation scripts, and bounded production experiments used alongside the author and series records.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Open first:</strong> <code>00_Interlanguage_Romance_Methodology_v10_Status_20260718.pdf</code>, a two-page reader-facing account of the current Romance v10 state and its reproducibility boundary. The exact v10 machine-gated payload is grouped in <code>14_Interlanguage_Romance_Methodology_v10_Evidence_20260718.zip</code>. The earlier v0.6 Interslavic normalization report remains available under its now-explicit <code>01_Interlanguage_Interslavic_Normalization_Method_v06_20260718</code> name.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Romance v10:</strong> the maintained infrastructure records 61 explicit language or variety routes, 148 corpus representations, 60 WordWeb concepts, 106 senses, 682 reviewed occurrences, 104 controlled terminology links, and a 194-row crosswalk to the current Noether Spanish and French terminology ledgers. Six bounded controlled-Romance production tranches, T001-T006, compile and reproduce their pinned renders. The validator passes 307 hash-bound targets.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Research boundary:</strong> the broader Romance program remains active and incomplete. Fifty-three routes still have no source body, 33 senses have no accepted support, and the 954-row access grid contains exactly zero human observations, zero pilot-eligible rows, and zero form promotions. Orthographic diagnostics are not intelligibility measurements. The T001-T006 outputs are not native-language validated, and this record does not claim a complete Romance translation or an empirical marginal-intelligibility index.</p>\n\n<p>The record also retains prior source-body transfer packages, Slavic and RTL/Persianate/Arabic/Romance/CJK/Turkic/Indigenous/SEA baselines, the weighted Interslavic automaton and term ledgers, v0.4/v0.5 research-department material, and v0.6 normalization evidence. Those earlier components remain version-labeled rather than being presented as the current Romance method.</p>\n\n<p>These are versioned working research artifacts for inspection, reproduction, correction, and continued development. They are not native/community certification, a critical edition, or proof that all linguistic choices are settled. Corrections can be proposed through the <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">GitHub mirror</a>.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Manuscript Typesetting Project", "affiliation": "Independent"}], "keywords": ["interlanguage", "Interslavic", "constructed languages", "mathematical translation", "corpus normalization", "paired scripts", "evidence graph", "term ledger", "source provenance", "reproducible audit", "AI-run workflow", "language management"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.20461174", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.20412587", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21421049", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "2026-07-18 Romance v10 semantic alignment and access infrastructure", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-zero"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 9, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21124403"}}]}, "notes": "Romance v10 adds hash-bound semantic alignment, Spanish/French terminology crosswalks, access infrastructure, and six bounded controlled-Romance production tranches. The four-stage program remains active and incomplete: it contains zero human intelligibility observations, 53 zero-body routes, and 33 unsupported senses. It does not certify language completion, native-speaker approval, empirical MII, translation fidelity, mathematical source fidelity, or critical-edition status."}, "title": "Interlanguage and Mathematical Translation Methodology Sidecar", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21422432", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21422432", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21422432?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21422432", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21422432", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21422432", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21422432/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21124403", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21124403", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21124403", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21124403", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21422432/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21422432/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21422432/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21422432/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21422432:00_Interlanguage_Romance_Methodology_v10_Status_20260718.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21422432:00_Interlanguage_Romance_Methodology_v10_Status_20260718.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.o